  <p id="c-songshu-042-wanghong:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-042-wanghong:p001:m0000" ref="85v_6zd_x1s_AAA">王弘</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-042-wanghong:p001:m0003" ref="85v_6zd_x1s_AAA">休元</persName>，琅邪臨沂人也。曾祖<persName id="c-songshu-042-wanghong:p001:m0015" ref="85v_6zd_x1s">導</persName>，晉丞相。祖<persName id="c-songshu-042-wanghong:p001:m0022" ref="85v_6zd_x1s_A">洽</persName>，中領軍。父<persName id="c-songshu-042-wanghong:p001:m0029" ref="85v_6zd_x1s_AA">珣</persName>，司徒。</p>
